{
  "uid": "ai-agents-usage",
  "title": "AI agents (使い方の内訳)",
  "description": "Managed by chezmoi from kosako/dotfiles (otel-backend module, #541). Where the tokens and work went: share per agent and model, and the kinds of tools used per day (events in Loki). Edit the JSON in dotfiles, not in the UI.",
  "tags": [
    "ai-agents",
    "usage"
  ],
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-29d/d",
    "to": "now/d"
  },
  "refresh": "5m",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "timezone": "Asia/Tokyo",
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "AI agents",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "ai-agents"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "targetBlank": false,
      "icon": "external link"
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**見ること**: token と手間を、どの agent・model・作業に使ったか。日ごとの割合の変化を見る。\n\n- tool は種類にまとめています (調べる・書く・command を実行・任せる・人に聞く・MCP・その他)。\n- 割合の棒は 1 日の合計を 100% にしたもので、tooltip には数そのものが出ます。棒は日本時間の 1 日ごとです。既定の期間は 29 日前の 0 時から今日の終わりまでで、今日の棒は今の時刻までの分です。期間の終わりを「now」にすると、0 時から 9 時の間は今日の棒が出ません。"
      },
      "transparent": true,
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "agent と model",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "token の割合 (agent ごと、1 日ごと)",
      "description": "cache を含む全部を 100% にした割合",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum (sum_over_time({service_name=~\"claude-code.*\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" | unwrap input_tokens [1d] offset -15h)) + sum (sum_over_time({service_name=~\"claude-code.*\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" | unwrap cache_read_tokens [1d] offset -15h)) + sum (sum_over_time({service_name=~\"claude-code.*\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" | unwrap cache_creation_tokens [1d] offset -15h)) + sum (sum_over_time({service_name=~\"claude-code.*\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" | unwrap output_tokens [1d] offset -15h))",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "Claude Code"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum (sum_over_time({service_name=~\"codex.*\"} | event_name=\"codex.sse_event\" | event_kind=\"response.completed\" | unwrap input_token_count [1d] offset -15h)) + sum (sum_over_time({service_name=~\"codex.*\"} | event_name=\"codex.sse_event\" | event_kind=\"response.completed\" | unwrap output_token_count [1d] offset -15h))",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "Codex"
        }
      ],
      "interval": "1d",
      "maxDataPoints": 400,
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 70,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisSoftMin": 0,
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "percent",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "token (model ごと、期間の合計)",
      "description": "cache を含む全部",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (model) (sum_over_time({service_name=~\"claude-code.*\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" | unwrap input_tokens [$__range])) + sum by (model) (sum_over_time({service_name=~\"claude-code.*\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" | unwrap cache_read_tokens [$__range])) + sum by (model) (sum_over_time({service_name=~\"claude-code.*\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" | unwrap cache_creation_tokens [$__range])) + sum by (model) (sum_over_time({service_name=~\"claude-code.*\"} | event_name=\"api_request\" | unwrap output_tokens [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (model) (sum_over_time({service_name=~\"codex.*\"} | event_name=\"codex.sse_event\" | event_kind=\"response.completed\" | unwrap input_token_count [$__range])) + sum by (model) (sum_over_time({service_name=~\"codex.*\"} | event_name=\"codex.sse_event\" | event_kind=\"response.completed\" | unwrap output_token_count [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "labelsToFields",
          "options": {
            "mode": "columns"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "calculateField",
          "options": {
            "mode": "reduceRow",
            "alias": "合計",
            "reduce": {
              "reducer": "sum",
              "include": [
                "Value #A",
                "Value #B",
                "Value"
              ]
            },
            "replaceFields": false
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true,
              "Value #A": true,
              "Value #B": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "合計",
                "desc": true
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rowsToFields",
          "options": {
            "mappings": [
              {
                "fieldName": "model",
                "handlerKey": "field.name"
              },
              {
                "fieldName": "合計",
                "handlerKey": "field.value"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "continuous-GrYlRd"
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "valueMode": "color",
        "namePlacement": "left",
        "sizing": "auto"
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "作業の種類",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Claude Code: tool の種類 (1 日ごとの割合)",
      "description": "tool_result を種類にまとめた数",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (count_over_time({service_name=~\"claude-code.*\"} | event_name=\"tool_result\" | label_format kind=`{{ if eq .tool_name \"Read\" \"Grep\" \"Glob\" \"LS\" \"WebFetch\" \"WebSearch\" \"ToolSearch\" }}調べる{{ else if eq .tool_name \"Edit\" \"Write\" \"MultiEdit\" \"NotebookEdit\" }}書く{{ else if eq .tool_name \"Bash\" \"PowerShell\" }}command を実行{{ else if eq .tool_name \"Agent\" \"Task\" \"Skill\" \"SendMessage\" \"SubagentHandback\" \"ListAgents\" }}任せる{{ else if eq .tool_name \"AskUserQuestion\" }}人に聞く{{ else if eq .tool_name \"mcp_tool\" }}MCP{{ else }}その他{{ end }}` [1d] offset -15h))",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}"
        }
      ],
      "interval": "1d",
      "maxDataPoints": 400,
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 70,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisSoftMin": 0,
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "percent",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Codex: tool の種類 (1 日ごとの割合)",
      "description": "codex.tool_result を種類にまとめた数",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (count_over_time({service_name=~\"codex.*\"} | event_name=\"codex.tool_result\" | label_format kind=`{{ if eq .tool_name \"exec_command\" \"exec\" \"write_stdin\" \"run\" }}command を実行{{ else if eq .tool_name \"apply_patch\" }}書く{{ else }}その他{{ end }}` [1d] offset -15h))",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}"
        }
      ],
      "interval": "1d",
      "maxDataPoints": 400,
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
